  unitName: Ice Mage Dean
  unitId: 20163
  unitNumber: 243
  description: "One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna. As a priest, Dean initially struggled with the idea of fighting against
    the gods\u2013\u2013until he saw the carnage they were wreaking, that is. He
    used his sway over the frosty elements to freeze his enemies in their tracks.
    Though often described as a rowdy, somewhat coarse individual, his relentless
    banter also served as a source of much-needed comic relief among the four warriors."
  summonDesc: "So you\u2019re the one who saw<br>fit to summon me?<br>Very well.
    When do we get started?"
  fusionDesc: "That\u2019s the stuff!<br>Now I\u2019m even stronger than before!<br>You
    and me: we\u2019re unstoppable!"
  evoDesc: "You\u2019re more capable than I thought.<br>Looks like I misjudged you.<br>Now
    let\u2019s show the world we mean business!"
